WEBVTT

00:02.960 --> 00:05.670
<b>THE ELUSIVE
SAMURAI</b>

01:25.290 --> 01:29.960
<b>THE ELUSIVE
SAMURAI</b>

01:30.670 --> 01:35.470
<b>FINAL EPISODE</b>

01:35.550 --> 01:39.340
<b><i>Though I see a future where you live,</i>
<i>it is not guaranteed.</i></b>

01:42.430 --> 01:45.560
<b><i>Naturally, if you neglect</i>
<i>the fight for survival, you will die.</i></b>

01:49.350 --> 01:54.570
<b><i>But the experience that you'll gain</i>
<i>by going into battle is immeasurable.</i></b>

01:56.110 --> 01:58.780
<b><i>I pray for your safe return,</i>
<i>Lord Tokiyuki.</i></b>

01:59.360 --> 02:01.780
<b>Let the women and children escape first!</b>

02:01.870 --> 02:03.790
<b>If they can escape
through the defensive barriers,</b>

02:03.870 --> 02:05.540
<b>we can hold off
the great enemy army there!</b>

02:05.620 --> 02:07.040
<b>HOSHINA'S ARMY
PROVINCIAL OFFICIAL'S ARMY</b>

02:07.120 --> 02:08.710
<b>Turn around!</b>

02:09.210 --> 02:11.880
<b>We'll defend as one unit
against the enemy from the rear!</b>

02:11.960 --> 02:17.800
<b>Listen, grunts!
The idiots are turning back!</b>

02:17.880 --> 02:20.140
<b>Provincial official's orders!</b>

02:20.220 --> 02:21.800
<b>Kill all the men!</b>

02:21.890 --> 02:25.310
<b>We'll divide the women, children,
and the loot equally!</b>

02:25.390 --> 02:26.810
<b>NANBOKUCHO GAME OF TAG</b>

02:26.890 --> 02:28.560
<b>BURNING DEMON BRIGADE
PROVINCIAL OFFICIAL'S GUARD</b>

02:28.640 --> 02:29.850
<b>HIS FACE LOOKS LIKE THIS</b>

02:29.940 --> 02:30.940
<b>According to Shizuku,</b>

02:31.020 --> 02:34.440
<b>the one named Yonemaru Wada is leading
the provincial official's private force.</b>

02:34.530 --> 02:36.530
<b>A FEW HOURS EARLIER
WITHIN THE HOSHINA PARTY CAMP</b>

02:36.610 --> 02:40.070
<b>If we can just take him down, we'll
weaken the provincial official's army.</b>

02:41.110 --> 02:42.280
<b>Take him down?</b>

02:42.780 --> 02:44.700
<b>You've got it backwards, Kojiro.</b>

02:44.790 --> 02:47.620
<b>First, we'll take advantage of him,
then weaken his army.</b>

02:51.500 --> 02:56.880
<b>Come on! Come on!
Follow me! Climb that mountain!</b>

02:56.960 --> 02:58.630
<b>What?</b>

02:58.720 --> 03:01.180
<b>Weren't we all going to chase down
the Hoshina party together?</b>

03:01.260 --> 03:02.550
<b>You idiots!</b>

03:02.640 --> 03:05.140
<b>We can surround the enemy from behind
if we go over the mountain!</b>

03:05.220 --> 03:07.770
<b>We can annihilate them
with a pincer attack!</b>

03:08.270 --> 03:11.020
<b>Follow me now or I'll kill you, got it?</b>

03:11.100 --> 03:12.900
<b>Yes, sir!</b>

03:12.980 --> 03:15.690
<b>This battle of retreat
will be on flat land.</b>

03:16.480 --> 03:18.440
<b>Tactics like ambushes can't be used,</b>

03:18.530 --> 03:21.320
<b>which puts the outnumbered Hoshina party
at a great disadvantage.</b>

03:21.410 --> 03:25.410
<b>In this case,
we want to divide the enemy's troops.</b>

03:25.950 --> 03:29.250
<b>And one of us has what it takes!</b>

03:30.080 --> 03:32.000
<b>Keep up with Lord Yonemaru!</b>

03:32.080 --> 03:33.460
<b>Keep climbing!</b>

03:33.540 --> 03:35.000
<b>What's happening?</b>

03:35.090 --> 03:37.460
<b>Lord Yonemaru, what is this?</b>

03:37.550 --> 03:38.380
<b>Hey.</b>

03:38.460 --> 03:44.390
<b>-Lord Yonemaru, please direct us!
-Hey… Hey… Hey… Hey?</b>

03:45.050 --> 03:45.890
<b>Hey?</b>

03:45.970 --> 03:46.970
<b>Hey, who am I again?</b>

03:47.060 --> 03:47.890
<b>POP</b>

03:47.970 --> 03:49.640
<b>Who the hell are you?</b>

03:49.730 --> 03:50.560
<b>Hup.</b>

03:50.640 --> 03:54.810
<b>I see. Yesterday, you memorized
how he looks to morph into him.</b>

03:58.940 --> 04:02.610
<b>Mr. Messenger's retainers
aren't too shabby.</b>

04:03.490 --> 04:05.070
<b>I get it.</b>

04:05.160 --> 04:09.660
<b>Kawanakajima's Suwa party are
all highly skilled.</b>

04:11.000 --> 04:13.040
<b>How do you like that, Mr. Messenger?</b>

04:13.750 --> 04:16.130
<b>We're strong when resigned to die,</b>

04:16.210 --> 04:19.000
<b>and we're also strong
when we are willed to live!</b>

04:19.590 --> 04:20.630
<b>Yes.</b>

04:21.630 --> 04:26.010
<b>Even so… Escaping won't be easy.</b>

04:27.010 --> 04:29.720
<b>After the women and children
relocate somewhere safe,</b>

04:29.810 --> 04:32.770
<b>we have to shake off the enemy and escape.</b>

04:33.440 --> 04:37.230
<b>Come to think of it,
where's your vigorous friend?</b>

04:38.980 --> 04:42.320
<b>I've ordered Kojiro
to move of his own accord.</b>

04:42.820 --> 04:46.160
<b>I'm sure he'll be of great help
to you and your men.</b>

04:48.160 --> 04:49.990
<b><i>I'll perform a hit-and-run.</i></b>

04:50.080 --> 04:53.830
<b><i>At my age,</i>
<i>I'm at a disadvantage against adults.</i></b>

04:54.670 --> 04:57.670
<b><i>I'll utilize my small stature</i>
<i>to escape to high ground</i></b>

04:57.750 --> 05:00.550
<b><i>and seek allies who need my assistance.</i></b>

05:03.050 --> 05:06.890
<b><i>I'll deliver an effective blow</i>
<i>then retreat to that high ground.</i></b>

05:08.180 --> 05:12.600
<b><i>By repeating this tactic, I've begun</i>
<i>to see the dynamic of the entire battle</i></b>

05:12.680 --> 05:14.730
<b><i>and where I should fight next.</i></b>

05:16.190 --> 05:18.110
<b><i>I want help from the Hoshina party.</i></b>

05:18.770 --> 05:20.570
<b><i>I need four or five men.</i></b>

05:20.650 --> 05:23.570
<b>Hey, mister! Please come with me!</b>

05:24.070 --> 05:27.360
<b>You, the old man
with focus lines all over your face!</b>

05:28.240 --> 05:29.740
<b>Focus lines all over my face?</b>

05:29.830 --> 05:32.200
<b>Don't make a straight face now.
It's confusing!</b>

05:32.290 --> 05:35.710
<b>You, the geezer with rectangular features
all over, come with me too.</b>

05:35.790 --> 05:38.290
<b>Rectangular features all over?</b>

05:38.380 --> 05:39.880
<b>I guess that's not me then.</b>

05:39.960 --> 05:43.920
<b>Ugh, don't suddenly add round elements!
Now I can't compare you to anything!</b>

05:44.010 --> 05:44.920
<b>What about me?</b>

05:45.010 --> 05:46.680
<b>Compare me to something!</b>

05:46.760 --> 05:49.090
<b>I don't know! You're some kind of monster!</b>

05:49.180 --> 05:50.300
<b>Just come with me!</b>

05:50.390 --> 05:51.970
<b>The enemy is moving along the riverbank</b>

05:52.060 --> 05:54.560
<b>aiming for the women
and children behind us.</b>

05:54.640 --> 05:57.440
<b>Let's band together
and invade them from the side!</b>

06:03.780 --> 06:05.690
<b>Not a damn chance!</b>

06:05.780 --> 06:07.320
<b>Nice work, baldy!</b>

06:07.400 --> 06:09.320
<b>I'm not bald! Take a good look!</b>

06:09.410 --> 06:11.660
<b>Hair grows on the back of my head,
but I shave it off!</b>

06:11.740 --> 06:14.040
<b>You guys are annoying!</b>

06:14.700 --> 06:18.460
<b><i>Actually, it's my fault</i>
<i>for not remembering my allies' names.</i></b>

06:18.540 --> 06:21.670
<b><i>From now on, I'll make</i>
<i>a round of hellos during mealtime.</i></b>

06:23.500 --> 06:24.670
<b>Fubuki!</b>

06:25.550 --> 06:27.170
<b>Why are you here?</b>

06:27.260 --> 06:29.430
<b>Your waiting post is further that way.</b>

06:33.140 --> 06:34.430
<b>Fubuki!</b>

06:37.140 --> 06:39.560
<b>Fubuki! Get a hold of yourself!</b>

06:39.650 --> 06:41.400
<b>Are you all right? Hey!</b>

06:43.860 --> 06:46.940
<b>I'm so hungry. I can't move.</b>

06:47.030 --> 06:48.990
<b>You're a dumb flake, aren't you?</b>

06:49.070 --> 06:52.320
<b>You sure do need a lot of calories
in exchange for being smart!</b>

06:52.410 --> 06:54.240
<b>Here, take this fresh manju.</b>

06:54.330 --> 06:56.410
<b>All right, I'm recharged and ready to go!</b>

06:56.500 --> 06:58.750
<b>Hurry up and go back to your waiting post.</b>

06:59.290 --> 07:03.790
<b>Please… Isn't your strategy supposed to be
the cornerstone of the Elusive Warriors?</b>

07:04.550 --> 07:05.880
<b>I'm not special.</b>

07:05.960 --> 07:08.130
<b>Anyone can strategize if you just learn.</b>

07:09.420 --> 07:12.720
<b>You run madly around the battlefield,
fighting selflessly,</b>

07:12.800 --> 07:15.600
<b>initiating conversations
and taking care of allies.</b>

07:16.270 --> 07:19.140
<b>It's a general like that who can become
the cornerstone of a party.</b>

07:19.230 --> 07:23.310
<b>Kojiro, you are a solid adjutant general
of the Elusive Warriors.</b>

07:32.070 --> 07:36.490
<b>Being complimented by someone overflowing
with talent only comes across as sarcasm.</b>

07:42.120 --> 07:44.380
<b>Old man with both rectangular
and circular features</b>

07:44.460 --> 07:45.960
<b>and the other guy that's mostly bald</b>

07:46.040 --> 07:48.710
<b>that shaves the little hair
that is growing on the back of his head!</b>

07:49.800 --> 07:50.970
<b>Hey.</b>

07:51.800 --> 07:55.390
<b>You destroyed my independent unit.</b>

07:56.100 --> 07:57.970
<b>You'll meet your end for this.</b>

08:04.480 --> 08:07.520
<b>You're an apprentice
at Suwa Grand Shrine, huh?</b>

08:07.610 --> 08:11.320
<b>Not that it's somethin'
to write home about.</b>

08:11.400 --> 08:13.070
<b>Shut up, pig.</b>

08:13.570 --> 08:17.370
<b>I'll scatter your smelly fat
around Chikuma River.</b>

08:18.660 --> 08:20.200
<b>-Let the best man win!
-Let the best man win!</b>

08:24.170 --> 08:26.590
<b><i>The top speed for</i>
<i>the fastest native Japanese horses</i></b>

08:26.670 --> 08:28.380
<b><i>is about 40 kilometers per hour,</i></b>

08:28.460 --> 08:32.720
<b><i>which is roughly the same speed as</i>
<i>the fastest punch of a professional boxer.</i></b>

08:33.630 --> 08:37.930
<b><i>This means that just by bracing one's</i>
<i>curved sword and charging on a horse,</i></b>

08:38.430 --> 08:40.220
<b><i>a blade is bound to come flying</i>
<i>at the opponent</i></b>

08:40.310 --> 08:42.230
<b><i>at the speed of the world's fastest jab.</i></b>

08:52.440 --> 08:54.360
<b><i>You're kidding…</i></b>

08:55.700 --> 08:56.870
<b>Whoa.</b>

08:58.830 --> 09:00.620
<b>What happened, chump?</b>

09:00.700 --> 09:04.160
<b>You talk big,
but are you as puny as you look?</b>

09:04.250 --> 09:05.420
<b>Ha!</b>

09:07.710 --> 09:09.090
<b><i>We have a difference in strength,</i></b>

09:09.170 --> 09:11.260
<b>-<i>weight…</i>
-Come on, come on!</b>

09:11.340 --> 09:13.420
<b>-<i>…and relative speed.</i>
-Come at me! Come on!</b>

09:13.510 --> 09:14.420
<b>Come on!</b>

09:14.510 --> 09:16.260
<b>Take this!</b>

09:18.600 --> 09:20.810
<b><i>I can't even block</i>
<i>his attacks effectively.</i></b>

09:21.390 --> 09:22.310
<b>Kojiro!</b>

09:22.390 --> 09:23.600
<b>Get back!</b>

09:23.680 --> 09:26.060
<b>You're no physical match on horseback!</b>

09:26.140 --> 09:27.810
<b>Just run!</b>

09:33.280 --> 09:36.240
<b><i>If I pull out,</i>
<i>it's over for those old geezers.</i></b>

09:36.320 --> 09:39.740
<b><i>Yonemaru will remain as</i>
<i>the only one on horseback.</i></b>

09:43.250 --> 09:45.830
<b><i>The infantry are</i>
<i>at a complete disadvantage</i></b>

09:45.910 --> 09:49.250
<b><i>compared to the cavalry</i>
<i>in terms of speed and strength.</i></b>

09:49.330 --> 09:51.670
<b><i>That's why he targeted</i>
<i>the two cavalrymen first.</i></b>

09:52.300 --> 09:56.630
<b><i>If I give up now,</i>
<i>that pig will begin his rampage!</i></b>

10:07.270 --> 10:10.440
<b>He weakens with every attack.</b>

10:11.270 --> 10:15.440
<b>He doesn't have the strength
to block my next strike.</b>

10:16.860 --> 10:18.610
<b>Hey! Kojiro!</b>

10:19.320 --> 10:20.700
<b>Don't worry about me!</b>

10:20.780 --> 10:23.080
<b>Finish the remaining enemy!</b>

10:26.660 --> 10:30.000
<b>Why does everyone know my name anyways?</b>

10:30.790 --> 10:35.460
<b>Oh, that's because Mr. Messenger
kept calling your name yesterday.</b>

10:36.550 --> 10:39.260
<b><i>Kojiro! Nice, Kojiro!</i></b>

10:39.340 --> 10:41.350
<b><i>Don't you dare die!</i></b>

10:41.430 --> 10:44.140
<b><i>Look, that's my retainer Kojiro!</i></b>

10:44.930 --> 10:48.190
<b><i>That's my friend Kojiro</i>
<i>killing it out there!</i></b>

10:49.650 --> 10:51.190
<b>So embarrassing…</b>

10:53.900 --> 10:54.900
<b><i>But…</i></b>

10:55.440 --> 10:56.940
<b><i>Kojiro!</i></b>

11:02.820 --> 11:04.120
<b>Kojiro!</b>

11:04.700 --> 11:07.000
<b><i>I have to get in at least one blow</i></b>

11:07.790 --> 11:11.920
<b><i>so that I don't embarrass my lord!</i></b>

11:20.680 --> 11:21.680
<b><i>No way.</i></b>

11:22.470 --> 11:25.600
<b><i>How did someone so large dodge that?</i></b>

11:26.180 --> 11:28.100
<b>Damn it… Little bastard!</b>

11:28.640 --> 11:31.900
<b>You think you're a real warrior?</b>

11:31.980 --> 11:34.190
<b>You'll pay for this!</b>

11:36.230 --> 11:39.860
<b><i>A general who can lead an army</i>
<i>sure is something else…</i></b>

11:40.450 --> 11:44.370
<b><i>The spirit of a general</i>
<i>is to be boisterous, huh.</i></b>

11:45.450 --> 11:47.870
<b><i>I guess I'll try it next time.</i></b>

11:48.700 --> 11:53.420
<b><i>But, damn… My strength… is gone…</i></b>

12:07.260 --> 12:08.560
<b>Oy, kid.</b>

12:16.020 --> 12:17.360
<b>Don't give out now.</b>

12:17.980 --> 12:20.650
<b>I can't let you die so easily.</b>

12:20.740 --> 12:23.280
<b>First I'll rip your arms off one by one…</b>

12:26.160 --> 12:29.040
<b>You let your guard down
and stopped your horse, didn't you?</b>

12:29.750 --> 12:32.790
<b>You've got nobody to help you now!</b>

12:34.290 --> 12:35.460
<b>Get him, Kojiro!</b>

12:36.170 --> 12:38.300
<b>He's your kill!</b>

12:39.090 --> 12:39.960
<b><i>Oh, man…</i></b>

12:41.260 --> 12:42.340
<b><i>It's fun!</i></b>

12:43.220 --> 12:47.010
<b><i>Fighting as a unit is fun!</i></b>

12:48.350 --> 12:50.100
<b>I am Kojiro of the Elusive Warriors!</b>

12:50.180 --> 12:52.480
<b>I'll take your head and your power!</b>

12:53.480 --> 12:55.230
<b>Take this!</b>

12:59.070 --> 13:01.030
<b>PROVINCIAL OFFICIAL'S MAIN ARMY</b>

13:01.110 --> 13:03.200
<b>Why are you all just standing there?</b>

13:03.280 --> 13:05.740
<b>I can't see through this damn fog!</b>

13:05.820 --> 13:08.740
<b>The enemy's rear guard
is fighting with all their might.</b>

13:08.830 --> 13:10.540
<b>They're stuck in a back-and-forth.</b>

13:10.620 --> 13:13.710
<b>Well, we'll be able to crush them
with our numbers,</b>

13:13.790 --> 13:16.830
<b>though the women and children
will get away at this rate.</b>

13:16.920 --> 13:19.670
<b>What? Chase after them, Ichikawa!</b>

13:19.750 --> 13:23.840
<b>I'll carefully pick my favorite women
to be a part of my paradise!</b>

13:23.920 --> 13:24.760
<b>WOMEN</b>

13:24.840 --> 13:28.350
<b>But if we go, you will be left with no…</b>

13:28.930 --> 13:32.100
<b>There's no need for guards
when the enemy are running away!</b>

13:32.180 --> 13:34.940
<b>Do you not understand military strategy,
you country bumpkin?</b>

13:35.020 --> 13:35.940
<b>OFFICIAL</b>

13:36.020 --> 13:37.940
<b>Is your own life so precious?</b>

13:38.020 --> 13:40.940
<b>If you're a soldier,
go fight with your life on the line!</b>

13:41.020 --> 13:42.530
<b>Tsk.</b>

13:42.610 --> 13:44.860
<b>Great…</b>

13:51.240 --> 13:52.660
<b>Lord Hoshina!</b>

13:52.740 --> 13:55.410
<b>All the women and children
escaped to the safe zone!</b>

13:55.500 --> 13:56.460
<b>Good!</b>

13:56.540 --> 13:58.920
<b>Ring the bell
to signal the army's retreat!</b>

13:59.000 --> 14:01.710
<b>Only the rear guard should stay
to distract the enemy!</b>

14:02.920 --> 14:05.090
<b>Mr. Messenger! You've done enough.</b>

14:05.170 --> 14:06.340
<b>Run!</b>

14:07.510 --> 14:09.300
<b>I cannot, Mr. Hoshina.</b>

14:10.010 --> 14:13.770
<b>I must take responsibility for
instructing you and your men to escape.</b>

14:15.180 --> 14:16.770
<b>It's not right that I come this far</b>

14:16.850 --> 14:19.560
<b>and be the only one who does not taste
the fear of being chased…</b>

14:19.650 --> 14:20.980
<b>Wow…</b>

14:21.060 --> 14:24.230
<b>Mr. Messenger, you care about us so much…</b>

14:24.320 --> 14:25.610
<b><i>It would be a waste!</i></b>

14:25.690 --> 14:27.820
<b>Withdraw! Withdraw!</b>

14:27.910 --> 14:30.740
<b>Oy! It's the chime to withdraw. Run!</b>

14:32.580 --> 14:33.580
<b>Okay.</b>

14:33.660 --> 14:35.200
<b>STAB STAB STAB</b>

14:36.250 --> 14:38.540
<b>Hoshina's army has begun to withdraw!</b>

14:38.620 --> 14:40.380
<b>Slice them from behind!</b>

14:41.790 --> 14:44.170
<b><i>Zigzagging and firing backwards?</i></b>

14:44.760 --> 14:47.590
<b><i>I can't move forward easily</i>
<i>with horses and arrows in the way.</i></b>

14:48.180 --> 14:49.590
<b><i>That damn brat!</i></b>

14:50.260 --> 14:53.100
<b><i>Even though we're almost winning…</i></b>

14:53.180 --> 14:56.680
<b>Sorry, but I'm not dying
from a fatal shot to my vitals.</b>

14:58.350 --> 15:01.690
<b><i>Once the enemy begins to think about</i>
<i>the rewards for winning the war,</i></b>

15:02.190 --> 15:05.110
<b><i>they will no longer risk their lives</i>
<i>at the front lines.</i></b>

15:06.280 --> 15:09.110
<b><i>Furthermore, as for the lord retreating</i>
<i>as the helm of the rear guard,</i></b>

15:09.200 --> 15:11.320
<b><i>the most perilous position…</i></b>

15:11.410 --> 15:13.910
<b>Brilliant! Mr. Messenger.</b>

15:16.910 --> 15:18.290
<b>Mr. Messenger!</b>

15:18.370 --> 15:21.920
<b><i>…you will earn immense trust</i>
<i>from their allies.</i></b>

15:23.000 --> 15:26.590
<b><i>Meanwhile, I'll finish the war</i>
<i>with my own blade!</i></b>

15:26.670 --> 15:27.800
<b><i>Crap!</i></b>

15:27.880 --> 15:29.880
<b><i>He's aiming for the provincial official!</i></b>

15:30.380 --> 15:33.010
<b><i>The blame will fall on me.</i>
<i>They'll kill me!</i></b>

15:33.640 --> 15:35.810
<b>My provincial official!
Incoming from the right!</b>

15:36.390 --> 15:37.640
<b>What?</b>

15:37.720 --> 15:41.140
<b>That incapable Ichikawa
is screaming something.</b>

15:41.230 --> 15:44.230
<b>He's still chickening out
after coming this far?</b>

15:44.310 --> 15:47.570
<b><i>Choosing the moment we'd leave</i>
<i>the provincial official's guard!</i></b>

15:47.650 --> 15:49.530
<b><i>The morning mist hiding his location!</i></b>

15:49.610 --> 15:52.490
<b><i>The army's footsteps masking his approach!</i></b>

15:52.570 --> 15:55.160
<b><i>Did he calculate all of this?</i></b>

15:56.330 --> 15:58.580
<b>Don't come back, coward!</b>

15:58.660 --> 16:02.000
<b>If you don't obey my tactics…</b>

16:02.750 --> 16:04.080
<b>Huh?</b>

16:10.420 --> 16:12.380
<b>My provincial official! Are you all right?</b>

16:12.470 --> 16:14.390
<b>He cut me!</b>

16:14.470 --> 16:16.010
<b>He cut me!</b>

16:16.100 --> 16:22.900
<b>He tried to kill me, the provincial
official appointed by the Emperor!</b>

16:23.480 --> 16:25.230
<b><i>Killing him would be a poor plan.</i></b>

16:25.310 --> 16:28.400
<b><i>An incompetent enemy general</i>
<i>is more useful alive.</i></b>

16:28.980 --> 16:30.400
<b>My provincial official!</b>

16:30.490 --> 16:32.320
<b>Beyond the river!</b>

16:32.400 --> 16:34.200
<b>There are large shadows of flags!</b>

16:34.280 --> 16:36.830
<b>We don't have allies there!</b>

16:38.990 --> 16:41.660
<b>Another troop coming for my head!</b>

16:42.460 --> 16:43.540
<b>Calm down.</b>

16:43.620 --> 16:45.790
<b>There's no sound of soldiers moving.</b>

16:45.880 --> 16:47.670
<b>They may have just raised flags
to trick us.</b>

16:47.750 --> 16:49.340
<b>You idiot!</b>

16:49.420 --> 16:51.380
<b>It looks like they're about to charge!</b>

16:51.470 --> 16:53.630
<b>Hurry, command Yonemaru's army back here!</b>

16:53.720 --> 16:56.430
<b>Sound the drums to signal withdrawal!</b>

16:59.520 --> 17:01.180
<b><i>Damn provincial official!</i></b>

17:01.270 --> 17:05.230
<b>Setaro! Take Yonemaru's place
and lead our soldiers to the front lines!</b>

17:05.310 --> 17:06.150
<b>Sir!</b>

17:06.230 --> 17:07.060
<b>HOSHINA TERRITORY</b>

17:07.150 --> 17:09.020
<b>Once you drive Hoshina beyond his barrier,</b>

17:09.110 --> 17:11.940
<b>build another one of our own
to secure the territory.</b>

17:12.030 --> 17:13.400
<b>PROVINCIAL OFFICIAL'S TERRITORY</b>

17:14.740 --> 17:18.830
<b><i>Our easy victory is ruined because of him!</i></b>

17:18.910 --> 17:22.160
<b><i>This provincial official is</i>
<i>a burden on us.</i></b>

17:22.250 --> 17:23.250
<b>Tsk.</b>

17:24.460 --> 17:27.040
<b>Oh! The enemy is withdrawing!</b>

17:28.040 --> 17:30.090
<b><i>Fubuki's strategy was a success!</i></b>

17:31.840 --> 17:35.220
<b>They'll come to attack us once
they realize the standards are decoys.</b>

17:35.300 --> 17:37.890
<b>Let's run past the barrier while we can!</b>

17:37.970 --> 17:39.220
<b>All right!</b>

17:52.440 --> 17:53.440
<b>My lord!</b>

17:53.530 --> 17:55.320
<b>Kojiro!</b>

17:55.400 --> 17:57.700
<b>-You took quite a while.
-Huh?</b>

17:58.570 --> 18:00.370
<b>You got the kill, right?</b>

18:00.450 --> 18:01.290
<b>Fubuki!</b>

18:01.370 --> 18:02.740
<b>It was amazing.</b>

18:02.830 --> 18:04.830
<b>He took down Yonemaru.</b>

18:04.910 --> 18:06.000
<b>Well done!</b>

18:06.080 --> 18:07.620
<b>Where is his head for proof?</b>

18:11.550 --> 18:13.760
<b>I left him with it.</b>

18:13.840 --> 18:16.800
<b>He taught me a lot.</b>

18:17.930 --> 18:22.390
<b>Even if I did have his head,
you can't give me a reward, right?</b>

18:22.470 --> 18:24.810
<b>Since you just lost half your territory.</b>

18:24.890 --> 18:26.020
<b>Shut up.</b>

18:26.100 --> 18:27.270
<b>It's true.</b>

18:28.350 --> 18:29.190
<b>Anyhow…</b>

18:30.270 --> 18:34.360
<b>Losing has never felt so good.</b>

18:35.150 --> 18:36.070
<b>Lord Hoshina!</b>

18:36.150 --> 18:37.200
<b>Mr. Messenger!</b>

18:37.780 --> 18:39.700
<b>Lord Hoshina, you're safe!</b>

18:39.780 --> 18:41.120
<b>Mr. Messenger!</b>

18:41.200 --> 18:43.490
<b>Lord Hoshina did it again!</b>

18:43.580 --> 18:47.960
<b>We lost our territory,
but it's as if we won.</b>

18:49.000 --> 18:54.250
<b>We get to see these smiles
because we escaped and survived.</b>

18:57.010 --> 19:00.010
<b><i>Afterwards, Hoshina ruled</i>
<i>a small area in northern Shinano,</i></b>

19:00.090 --> 19:03.680
<b><i>and he was driven out to the south.</i></b>

19:05.100 --> 19:08.100
<b><i>Lords often change</i>
<i>as time passes. However…</i></b>

19:08.980 --> 19:09.980
<b>Boing.</b>

19:12.020 --> 19:14.650
<b><i>By skillfully overcoming crises</i>
<i>time and time again,</i></b>

19:14.730 --> 19:16.400
<b>-<i>the Hoshina party became…</i>
-Good work!</b>

19:16.490 --> 19:18.740
<b><i>…a resilient feudal lord lineage</i>
<i>that endured until the Meiji era.</i></b>

19:19.360 --> 19:22.450
<b><i>And more importantly for Tokiyuki,</i></b>

19:22.530 --> 19:27.000
<b><i>they would become a crucial military force</i>
<i>in the nearing uprising.</i></b>

19:28.080 --> 19:31.670
<b>Please let Myojin know that we,
the Hoshina party,</b>

19:31.750 --> 19:35.750
<b>were saved by Mr. Messenger
and his retainers.</b>

19:35.840 --> 19:38.590
<b>Let him know that we'll treasure
the precious life we were given</b>

19:38.670 --> 19:44.260
<b>whether by losing or escaping, and we
shall dedicate our lives to serve Myojin.</b>

19:45.430 --> 19:46.600
<b>Yes.</b>

19:46.680 --> 19:47.680
<b>GRUMBLE</b>

19:48.770 --> 19:52.310
<b>Mr. Messenger,
please stop by our territory.</b>

19:52.900 --> 19:55.570
<b>We don't have much,
but we want to repay you.</b>

19:56.690 --> 19:58.070
<b>Dinner!</b>

20:00.700 --> 20:05.370
<b>You know, brat,
it's rude to refuse a gift.</b>

20:06.410 --> 20:09.080
<b>I want to return quickly
to let them know we're safe.</b>

20:09.160 --> 20:10.750
<b>Everyone's probably worried.</b>

20:11.420 --> 20:13.630
<b>You can stay here by yourself, you know.</b>

20:13.710 --> 20:16.800
<b>The Young Lord only needs us as guards.</b>

20:16.880 --> 20:20.420
<b>I was given a gift, as well, so…</b>

20:20.510 --> 20:23.260
<b>Tsk. Goody Two-shoes.</b>

20:23.340 --> 20:24.470
<b>Thank you.</b>

20:24.550 --> 20:27.220
<b>Kojiro, Fubuki, Genba.</b>

20:28.270 --> 20:31.270
<b>Oh, I don't need
a thank-you dinner or anything…</b>

20:38.440 --> 20:39.440
<b>Okay!</b>

20:39.530 --> 20:42.610
<b>My lord, you performed brilliantly.</b>

20:42.700 --> 20:46.660
<b>You owe me a lot of money for this war.</b>

20:56.420 --> 20:58.630
<b>Oh, I fell asleep.</b>

20:59.920 --> 21:01.470
<b>Father?</b>

21:02.090 --> 21:03.630
<b>The war is over.</b>

21:04.380 --> 21:07.350
<b>Lord Tokiyuki will return soon.</b>

21:10.970 --> 21:13.230
<b>I'm so glad the Young Lord is safe!</b>

21:13.310 --> 21:14.850
<b>Let's celebrate when he returns.</b>

21:14.940 --> 21:17.560
<b>Yes! Let's make a lot of delicious food!</b>

21:17.650 --> 21:19.690
<b>We have to prepare before he returns.</b>

21:19.780 --> 21:21.650
<b>Let's cook some meat to give him energy.</b>

21:21.740 --> 21:24.450
<b>Don't blow it into too many pieces.</b>

21:25.110 --> 21:27.490
<b>Let's continue to build alliances!</b>

21:27.570 --> 21:29.120
<b>We'll turn samurai who want to die</b>

21:29.200 --> 21:31.500
<b>into samurai who want to live
and fight with us!</b>

21:32.120 --> 21:33.120
<b>Huh?</b>

21:41.670 --> 21:44.630
<b>What happened? Is there an enemy?
What's gotten into you?</b>

21:44.720 --> 21:45.930
<b>There's a rainbow.</b>

21:46.010 --> 21:47.470
<b>Yes, I see it too.</b>

21:47.550 --> 21:49.510
<b>Hey, don't spray it on me.</b>

22:04.740 --> 22:06.740
<b>THE ELUSIVE SAMURAI</b>

23:38.960 --> 23:39.830
<b><i>Let's go!</i></b>
